# UX workflow: switch views through the global View Selector.
# Purpose: validates global LEFT_TOP long-press, overlay authority, NAV navigation,
# and confirm routing.

0 capture screen boot

# Hold LEFT_TOP long enough to open the global view selector.
100 button LEFT_TOP down
1150 tick
1200 capture screen selector_open
1250 button LEFT_TOP up

# Move to the next view and confirm with the NAV button.
1350 encoder NAV 1
1450 capture screen selector_moved
1500 tap NAV 60
1700 capture screen confirmed_view
